        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koolekejiwa kwa ng'wa Paulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shinigeleelilwe ū kwikumīlīja nūūlū īkī ītīho solobo; ali lūūlū, leki nagalūkīle mihayo īyo Seeba akīyoolechaga na kwīkundūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamanile munhū nebe mulī Kilisito, ūyo akahwehulwa ūtwalwa kūshisha kwigūlū lya kadatū. Ū haha yabītaga myaka ikūmi n'īne, hīmba olī mu mīlī, nūūlū hīmba olī hanze ya mīlī, natamanile; Mulungu agūmanile ū gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana naamanile ū munhū ng'wenūyo, alīyo ūlū olī mu mīlī nūūlū hanze ya mīlī natamanile; ū Mulungu amanile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo akahwehulwa ūtwalwa paladiso, ūūkigwa mihayo īyo munhū atazunīlījiwe kwīsomboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, nakwikumīlīja kūlwa nguno yakwe ū munhū ng'wenūyo, alīyo ūlū kūlwa nguno yane nene ng'wenekīlī, natūdūla ū kwikumīlīja; ūlū ītī kūlwa būgokolo bone dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nahene nūūlū nakikumīlīja natūbiza nchilū chilū, nguno nakūbiza nalīhaya ya ng'hana. Alīyo nakwilemejaga, nguno natatogilwe munhū ose ose anibalīle mitaale kūtinda ūmo akūnibonelaga, nū mumo akwīyigwīlaga īyo nakwīyītaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū kūlwa nguno ya kūkundūlīlwa mihayo mitaale gīko, nakatūūlīlwa ling'hwa mu mīlī, itūng'wa lya ng'wa Shetani, gīkī līninwamye, natizikumīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakashisha ng'hangala idatū nakūng'wikūmbīlījaga ū Seeba, gīkī ū mhayo gwenūyo gūnīngīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūniwīla gīkī, “Ī shigongo shane shikwigelile, nguno ū būdūla bone būkashikanaga mu būgokolo!” Hū kūhaya ū nene nakongeja kwikumīlīja kūlwa kūbūyegela ū būgokolo bone, gīkī ū būdūla bo ng'wa Kilisito bongeje kwikala ū mulī nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū nene nakūyejiagwa na būgokolo, būsondagūlwa, būgayiwa, būluhiwa, na makoye, kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Kilisito; nguno ū nene ūlū nalī na būgokolo, hū nalī na būdūla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būtogwa bo ng'wa Paulo kū Bakolinto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gete angū mmho nose naachilūhala! Alīyo mulīnenheleja bing'we, abo yalī īng'wigeleelilwe munigaliile. Nguno shitīho gete īsho banilebije a batūng'wa a bataale, nūūlū īkī ū nene natī shikolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ī mihayo ya koolecha ūmo balī a batūng'wa īkabeejiwa ū mu bing'we mu wiyūmīlīja bose, mu nzīla ya shimanīkījo na milīmo ya kūkumya, na shītwa sha būdūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī mukaleba mu mhayo kī ū kūlenganīla nī kanisa ī jingī, ūlū ītī gīkī dūhū ū nene natamusesegije nigo a bing'we? Nilekejagi ū būhūbi wenūbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managi gīkī namalīīlile kwiza ko ū kū bing'we. Ū lwenūlū lūkūbiza lūkangala lo kadatū, alīyo nī hangī natūmubuna; ū nene natizaga kūlwa shikolo shing'we, naliza kūlwa nguno ying'we. Nguno ītabeelelile a baana bayūsūmbya sabo kūlwa babyaji, alīyo a babyaji hū bene abo bakabīkaga sabo kūlwa baana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nalī na būyegi no ū kūshitūmamīla īsho nalī nasho, nū kwifunya nene ng'wenekīlī kūlwa nguno ya būpanga wing'we. Nīyo namutogilwe hataale no, a bing'we hū mugelele kūnitogwa hado dūhū? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gwene nahene gūtī na mhayo ni gūjage gīko. Gwike ū nene natang'winhile nigo a bing'we. Kolaga hamo naalī na masala no, nakamugwasha mu nyasala sala! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo nakang'wiboneela nūsola shikolo shing'we mu nzīla ya ng'wa ose ose ū mu banhū abo nakabatūma bize ū kū bing'we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakanomba Tito ize koi, nūbatūma kwiza ko nū ndūgū wise; kolaga hamo ū Tito akang'wiboneela shi? Hamo ī nhūngwa ja kashimīzīle kise jalī jitalenganīlile, nose twalī tūtajīlanījaga ū mu moyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo ng'wandije kwiganika gīkī ī mihayo īyo tūkūmuwīlaga īlī ya kwigunīja bise benekīlī? Managi gīkī īyo tūkwīsomboolaga yenīyo, tūkwīsomboolaga mulī Kilisito, kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu; hama pyī īyo tūkūyītaga īlī ya kūmuzenga bing'we batogwa bise! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we, nalogoha natizūshika ko namusange mutī gīt'ūmo natogelilwe, na a bing'we munibone ū nene natī gīt'ūmo mutogelilwe. Hamo nakūsanga mukūkoyiagwa wilemeelwa, wilu, kwisaayīla, wilwisha, būlwisanya, būsīgani, wikumīlīja na wiyugagūji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīnomba ū Mulungu one atizūnidoheleja hangī ū kū būtongi wing'we, ūlū nalize ko! Nguno bingī abo baalī bīīta shibi bakūnilīja būpīna, ūlū nalabasange bataalī kūgalūka na kūlekana nabo ū būsoso nū būjingi, nū būbi ūbo baalī bawīta!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
